{
  "name": "RAG support - retrieval and escalation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n\n**1. Start the service on the machine that holds the corpus:**\n```\nuvicorn service:app --app-dir src --port 8000\ncloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:8000\n```\n\n**2. Paste the tunnel URL** into the `Ask the retrieval service` node.\n\n**3. Set `RAG_SERVICE_SECRET`** in this n8n instance's environment, to the same value the service reads. The tunnel URL is public: without the shared header the endpoint is an open Anthropic API key.\n\nRetrieval config is `hybrid_rerank`, `top_k=3` - the configuration measured in RESULTS.md.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, -180],
      "id": "a1f0c2d4-1111-4a0b-9c31-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - setup"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "rag-support",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [40, 20],
      "id": "a1f0c2d4-2222-4a0b-9c31-000000000002",
      "name": "Customer message",
      "webhookId": "b7c1e6a2-4f3d-4a58-9d21-5e2f7c9a1b40"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://REPLACE-WITH-TUNNEL-URL/answer",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameter": [
            {
              "name": "X-Service-Secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.RAG_SERVICE_SECRET }}"
